    "description": "Solely responsible for supporting the Bankruptcy and Consumer Credit Counseling department duties include:\n\nCreated a Bankruptcy and Consumer Credit Counseling application that automates the support team mainframe functionality.\n\nTrained all new employees on the Bankruptcy and Consumer Credit Counseling application. \n\nTrained all employees on new releases of the Bankruptcy and Consumer Credit Counseling application.\n\nControl of the planning, designing, developing, testing, implementation, documentation and maintenance of the automated client/server systems \n\nDeveloped in Visual Basic 6.0 & .NET using COM components and Microsoft SQL 2000.\n\nInteract with business users to gather information and define needed application creations, updates and enhancements.\n\nDeveloped stored procedure and DTS packages including ActiveX scripts and error handling in SQL server to automate tasks as needed.\n\nResponsible for creating daily and monthly projection productivity reports using Crystal Reports 10.\n\nDeveloped a collection support management system that automates management daily task: tracks user performance, creates detail reporting, modifies database entries and performs charge offs.",
